1
00:00:00,032 --> 00:00:05,460
A guided walkthrough — sign in, scope crew and pairings to the ADD base, and open the Gantt.

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:10,888
Logging in to ROIS as Ryan.

3
00:00:10,888 --> 00:00:12,648
Enter the user code “Ryan”.

4
00:00:12,648 --> 00:00:14,710
Enter the password.

5
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,490
Click Sign In to enter ROIS.

6
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:21,940
Navigate to the Live scheduling view.

7
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,680
Open the Live view from the top navigation.

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,358
Live starts empty — click here to choose what to load.

9
00:00:25,358 --> 00:00:30,768
Scope both crew and pairings to the Addis Ababa (ADD) base.

10
00:00:30,768 --> 00:00:32,074
Open the Crew filter tab.

11
00:00:32,074 --> 00:00:33,256
Open the crew Base selector.

12
00:00:33,256 --> 00:00:34,508
Select ADD — Addis Ababa — for crew.

13
00:00:34,508 --> 00:00:35,736
Now open the Pairing filter tab.

14
00:00:35,736 --> 00:00:36,962
Open the pairing Base selector.

15
00:00:36,962 --> 00:00:38,156
Select ADD for pairings too.

16
00:00:38,156 --> 00:00:39,406
Apply the filter and open the Gantt.

17
00:00:39,406 --> 00:00:41,836
Loading the ADD-base roster and pairings…

18
00:00:41,836 --> 00:00:47,252
Jump the timeline to the current roster period.

19
00:00:47,252 --> 00:00:48,482
Right-click the time axis to open “GO TO RP”.

20
00:00:48,482 --> 00:00:49,678
Select the current roster period (marked “now”).

21
00:00:49,678 --> 00:00:55,088
ADD base is loaded — 2 crew rosters and 1502 pairings on the Gantt.
